{"server":"cn","storyId":"act40side_level_act40side_st03","groupId":"act40side","stageId":"act40side_st03","title":"须问汤","storyCode":"OR-ST-3","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act40side/level_act40side_st03.txt","sourceHash":"f012a508143d2f4b98f7ca228ed3150b5af9dbb8ddc5a366f3202916a7284712","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在很久以前，岁陵中诞生出第十二个新生的意识。这缕懵懂的意识与古老而庞大的存在对谈，关于这浩大的人间，他有许多疑问。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"......今夕何夕？\n幽暗的陵墓不见天日，在这片混沌黑暗中，仿佛时间都已静止。\n距离这里上一次传来动静已经过去多久？\n而这一天，这里多出了一道声音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"这是哪里......？\n陵墓。\n我是谁？\n不知。\n......你是谁？\n也不知。\n不过......他们给我起过一个名字。\n“岁”。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_i15_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"你留在这里，很久了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g3_baizaomainstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大理寺官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1630_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虞先生，上车吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下还有个不情之请。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位兄弟，行个方便。帮我去那马路对面的小饭馆，买碗白饭，讨杯茶水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要入大狱，也不好空着肚子去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大理寺官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1630_1","isRemote":false,"text":"分内的事，您稍等。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"判决已下，总不好一直赖在大理寺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道......今日专程，来送送您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你倒是不怨我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然已经知晓事情全貌，又何怨之有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要怨，也只能怨您没有早些告诉我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若我早些告诉你，恐怕现在你也得戴上这副镣铐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总要为大理寺留下几个好苗子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对前辈的定罪，我也提出过异议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实，前辈若是觉得量刑不公，大可申请三法司复审——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道你觉得，我的所作所为，担不起这十年牢狱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可您做的这一切，终究是为了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那又如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法就是法，不是“道义”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今日的虞澄若不服法，将来又会有多少个虞澄，为了他们各自的“道义”，造出多少乱事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还说这样的蠢话，不像我带出来的徒弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚辈失言......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，要如何让这个“法”，接近更多人心中的道义，那就是你们后来人的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会等着......山上的那棵松树还在，我还等着到时候，你把它砍下来给我做棺材。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，你今日来给我送行，为何不穿大理寺的官服？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我辞官了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一道惊雷，能照亮眼前一瞬，但它断不清世上一切是非黑白与真假善恶。我看不清的事还有很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"山上的那棵青松还在，但到底也只是一棵青松而已。登山人在这棵青松上看到了什么，还要看登山人自己的心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会回天师府，再修行一段时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想不明白的事，稀里糊涂地做下去，总归做不出名堂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前辈......我最后，还有一事不解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您究竟为何......执意要查太师的案子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......为什么这么问？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我整理了这件案子的前后资料，才发现，为这案子付出一切的，不止顾筌一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顾筌如此尚有动机，可您除了当年奉命厘清大理寺未解决的旧案，与这件案子并无直接关联。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大理寺官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1630_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虞先生，给您打的饭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大理寺官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1630_1","isRemote":false,"text":"余味居的跑堂，说什么也不肯收钱，还说随时等着您再到店里去做客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大理寺官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1630_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪，我也没说是给您打的饭呀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想起几十年前，我第一次在饭馆里遇见顾筌的时候，他跟我说什么“五色令人目盲，五味令人口爽”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我后来才想明白，到底还是因为我这人目光短浅，舌头粗钝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眼中只能见得清白真相，嘴里只咽得下清白滋味。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"身穿囚服的男人回过头，望向了大理寺的门匾，望向了藏在门后的决院。\n他躬下身，掬起柏树下一抔未化的残雪，撒入碗中，三两口扒完了饭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好滋味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......且去也。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_i15_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"你为什么会留在这里？\n因为我犯下的一个错误......一次疏忽......\n我可以感受到，你很痛苦，你很愤怒......\n但过去了很久，你的伤口在愈合，你的愤怒也在平息。\n......你听上去很疲惫？"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_i15_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"是......\n我的意识，我的灵魂，都已经分化为许多部分。\n就像你一样......\n他们都去哪了？\n这座陵墓外，名为“人间”的地方。\n“人间”......那里是个很美的地方吗？\n并不是......\n在那里，我见过最凶残的屠戮，最狠毒的阴谋，最残忍的背叛！\n至亲相残，至爱成仇......\n傲慢造就了我的失败，因为我不懂“人心”。\n既然你说，人间是如此险恶、丑陋的地方......\n那为什么，他们还要去呢？\n因为......"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睚","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哟，走了这么远了，还准备上哪去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睚","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......与你何干？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在大炎的地界上撒泼耍浑，还想让我当看不见？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们这些老东西，我看是伤疤没好就忘了痛。我们当年能把你们揍一顿，从这片土地上赶出去，现在照样能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睚","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就凭你一人？可笑......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，想打架？行啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你肚子里装下了几片小天地，我倒要看看你和那个画画的谁的本事更大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"残山剩水，经得住我几把火？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睚","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会为你的挑衅付出代价。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，就算在这宰了你，你还是能原样再捏一个出来，没什么意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睚","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你在找一个退缩的理由，我可以接受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"懒得和你掰扯，在我找到你的本体，彻底干掉你之前，我还想问你一个问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是很好奇，那个臭棋篓子到底许了什么好处，让你心甘情愿听他使唤？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对......应该说，“你们”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睚","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的谋划与我无关，我们不过是有些共同目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睚","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要找的，是那个被囚禁在陵墓里的，可耻的叛徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是真心想报仇，早就该将祂那些个分身一一杀了，然后等着祂死在和大炎的战争里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么多年过去了，你所谓的“同族”，这片大地上也不剩几只了吧......你到底还是念旧的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看在这点“人情味”上，倒不能把你们和野兽等同视之了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睚","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......荒唐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......不对，这也不是你和他合谋的全部理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别以为能骗过我，这么多年来，炎国一直留着几双眼睛在盯着你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老天师”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1238_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们还惦记着，百灶城下的那个东西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"睚","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance2_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鲤叔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爸他......会在这里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟着能打听到的消息，只能找到这里来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......和他分别这么多年来，我倒头一回希望关于他的传闻是假的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是那个传闻中打遍武林，甚至多次故意伤人的武疯子，也实在没法想象会有第二个人了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爸，为什么会变成那样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是这世上第一等的痴人，可越是痴人，心智越不该被动摇的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个声音？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"槐琥......一会见到他，千万要小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许现在只有你能叫醒他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鲤叔......我们走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（难道那把剑，真的是劫数......？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（梁洵啊梁洵......要是槐天裴有个三长两短，这笔账就只能记在你的头上了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_5"},{"type":"narration","text":"隔着尚远的一段距离，山洞深处，隐约可见一个魁梧的身影。\n沉重的拳头不住地砸在岩壁上，在上面留下了点点梅花似的血斑。每一拳落下，都震得整座洞穴摇摇晃晃。\n来人这才意识到，这个“山洞”，竟是被此人一拳一拳打出来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疯癫的喃语","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"四十年......天下第一......我何时......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疯癫的喃语","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"剑......不可给人......丢了......还是丢了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疯癫的喃语","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"女儿......不许伤害我的女儿！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爸......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爸......醒一醒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爸！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多能看到百灶了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"这座驿馆，竟也算故地重游。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎么，你们坚持要陪我一同过来，现在却一言不发？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"在这里死去的，皆是我们的兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"也皆是为了“忠义”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"魏公，有人跟随。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"当心——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"好剑法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"多年不见，你的剑法与当年已不可同日而语。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"......陈家小姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_790_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不见......魏彦吾......舅舅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"晖洁......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_790_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本以为在龙门做的事，就是你能做出的最愚蠢的决定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_790_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，还有你带着的这些人......现在又打算如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......你不该在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"难道是文月......告诉了你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_790_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我自己的决定，与他人无关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"这件事同样与你无关——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_790_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......的确。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_790_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从来没有问过你过去的事，我想那是你的私事，我也无权干涉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_790_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这几年我又去过了许多地方，见过不少没见过、没想过的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_790_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想明白了，这世上万般矛盾，总有一个“公义”可言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_790_1","isRemote":false,"text":"母亲的事......姐姐的事......不能说与你的过往无关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_790_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我想亲眼看看，这段纠缠了你一辈子的往事，究竟要怎样收场。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_i15_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"我似乎想起了许多事。\n在这具庞大的躯体内，通过这双穿过雾霭的双眼，曾看到的。\n你原本就是这具神识的一部分，也理所当然拥有这些记忆。\n可是......我看到的人间，与你所说的，并不一致。\n那你看到的又是什么？\n一团火。\n在最初的最初，人们团聚在一起，为了抵抗凶猛的野兽，为了照明冰冷寒夜，点起的一团火。\n人们围着这团火，铸造出各式各样的工具，烹制出各式各样的菜肴。他们的脸上有许多种我无法理解的表情......\n我很想知道，那是什么样的感觉？\n这样的念头，很危险......\n危险？\n你的同类，那些已经行走在人间的分身，他们都怀揣着相似的念头走入人间，可等着他们的，也只有无尽的折磨。\n他们......都想要成为人？\n可是在成为人之前，我想先想明白......\n“什么是人？”\n我该到哪里去寻找答案......\n呵......去吧。\n去“人间”走一遭。\n七情六欲，爱恨嗔贪，都会带来无尽的苦痛。一念既起，便如混沌开窍。一旦牵绊其中，便永远不可挣脱。\n......你不害怕？\n我......"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_i15_2"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g13_yuskitchen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"余","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"余","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......原来是梦啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"余","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过会梦到祂也不奇怪就是了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"余","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人呢......"},{"type":"narration","text":"小大厨从躺椅上跳下来，使劲伸了个懒腰，又努力揉了揉眼睛。\n眼前的厨房还是原来的模样，锅碗瓢盆皆在原处。\n忽然间，他像是想起了什么，匆忙打开橱柜，抱出一堆装着油盐酱醋的瓶子。\n他小心翼翼地依次将每一味调料送入口中，眉头紧锁，仔细思索。\n过了许久，笑容才在他脸上浮现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"余","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还好......还好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"余","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是一样的滋味......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"余","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是人是兽，记不记得，好像也没差嘛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"余","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"世味悠悠，这一路要找的滋味也都算找到了，再往后的事啊......不想了不想了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"余","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今朝有味今朝醉，明日愁来明日愁......也没什么大不了的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"余","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先开张吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","aliases":["魏彦吾"]}]}
